Ask "What is income of month?" and call the answer income.
Ask "What is rent?" and call the answer rent.
Ask "What is utilities?" and call the answer utilities.
Ask "What is insurance?" and call the answer insurance.
Ask "What is phone?" and call the answer phone.
Let left be income minus rent minus utilities minus insurance minus phone.
Show left.
If left is less than $500, say "Money is low this month!"
Ask "How much you want save every month?" and call the answer save.
Let months be 5000 divided by save.
Show months.
